Destroy an opposing 12000 BP or less Spirit. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up on your Removed Zone. If you control any "Terra Dragon" family Spirit with Advent, instead of sending it to the Removed Zone, you can add this card as a pre-advent to it.

 [LV1][LV2] While you control any Spirit with Advent, this Spirit gains an extra Red symbol.

When the Burst condition of this card in Hand is fulfilled, if you have at least one Yellow-only card in your Trash, you can activate this card's Burst. This effect can only be used once per turn.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
Put a core from the Void to your Life. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost, and you can set a card with Burst effects from your Hand.

This Brave does not exhaust, and while in Spirit condition, cannot attack nor block.

During Right Brave {{ua|Yellow/Blue}}
The Spirit is unaffected by opposing Yellow/Blue Spirit/Ultimate/Nexus/Magic effects.

During Left Brave {{ha|Purple/White}}
The Spirit is unaffected by opposing Purple/White Spirit/Brave/Nexus/Magic effects.

