[LV1][LV2][LV3] (When Advents/Attacks)
Discard an opposing Burst. Or, return an opposing Spirit/Ultimate to the deckbottom.

[LV2][LV3] {{ha|Red/Purple/Green/Blue}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Red/Purple/Green/Blue Spirit/Brave/Nexus/Magic effects.

