[LV3][LV4][LV5]
When your "Divine Spirit" family Spirits/Ultimates are destroyed by opposing effects, return them to your Hand. When this Ultimate returns to your Hand via this effect, you can put a core from the Void to your Life.

While there are four or more cores on one of your Grandwalker Nexuses, this set card is unaffected by opposing effects.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Spirit's (When Summoned/Advents) effect resolves}}
Destroy an opposing 15000 BP or less Spirit/Ultimate. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3][LV4] (When Attacks)
By sending two cores from your Grandwalker Nexuses to the Void, refresh this Spirit.

{{sumcon|Your Life is at six or less}}

{{Burst|After an opposing Spirit attacks}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, send up to two cores, besides , from any other "Divine Spirit" family Ultimates you control to your Life.

[LV5] (When Attacks)
By sending up to three cores from your Life to this Ultimate/any Yellow-only Grandwalker Nexuses you control, for each core sent, return an opposing Spirit to the deckbottom, in any order.

{{Burst|After Your Life Decreases}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Destroy an opposing 30000 BP or less Spirit/Ultimate. Effects of the destroyed Spirit/Ultimate cannot activate. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3][LV4] (When Attacks)
Destroy an opposing Spirit/Ultimate with BP equal or inferior to this Spirit's. Also, if you have a Burst set, you can target and attack an opposing Spirit/Ultimate.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Send three cores from any opposing Spirits/Ultimates to the Trash. After that effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3] (When Attacks)
You can destroy an opposing exhausted Spirit/Ultimate, and when destroys, if your Life is at three or less, send a core from any opposing Life/Spirit/Ultimate to the Void.

{{Burst|After your Spirit is depleted/destroyed by the opponent}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Return an opposing exhausted Spirit/Ultimate to the deckbottom. Also, send an opposing Spirit/Ultimate to the Removed Zone. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3] (When Attacks)
When only the opposing Spirit/Ultimate is destroyed by BP comparison, send an opposing Life to the Void, and refresh this Spirit.

{{Burst|After your Spirit/Ultimate is destroyed by the opponent}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, if there is any Yellow-only card in your Trash, put a core from the Void each to your Life and to a Grandwalker Nexus you control.

[LV2][LV3] Flash - (Either Attack Step)
Once per turn, by banishing three cards from your decktop, during this turn, an opposing Spirit/Ultimate's BP becomes 1000 BP.

{{Burst|After an opposing Spirit/Ultimate's (When Summoned) effect resolves}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Discard five cards from the opposing decktop. If a Cost 4/7 card is discarded by this effect, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] Great Crush (When Attacks)
For each LV this Spirit has, discard five cards from the opposing decktop, and when a card with Burst effects is discarded, destroy an opposing Spirit.
